{% comment %}
@description: Khung bao ngoai moi trang — <head> (title/meta/JSON-LD SEO), goi header/footer, cho block content chen vao giua.
@required_substrings: {% block content %}{% endblock %}, cdn.tailwindcss.com, pageTitle, {% render "header", {% render "footer", {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", {% render "components/common/cart-drawer", /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js
@required_ids:
@notes: PHAI giu <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title> - MOI route (blog.ts/pages.ts/products.ts...) deu tinh rieng pageTitle/metaDescription/noindex/schemas cho tung trang, truoc day layout.liquid bo qua het 4 bien nay (title hardcode = site.siteName cho MOI TRANG, khong co meta description/noindex/JSON-LD gi ca - da sua). PHAI giu <meta name="description"> khi co metaDescription, <meta name="robots" content="noindex"> khi noindex truthy, va vong lap {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %} (schemas la array object thuong, filter "json" co san trong LiquidJS mac dinh, KHONG can tu dang ky). PHAI giu nguyen script Tailwind CDN (co the doi query plugin), PHAI giu {% block content %}{% endblock %} de noi dung tung trang chen vao, PHAI goi {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %} va {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}, PHAI giu {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", ... %} o trong layout de breadcrumb hien toan site khi route truyen breadcrumbs, PHAI goi {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %} ngay truoc the dong body, PHAI giu the <link> toi /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css va <script> toi .../custom.js (CSS/JS tuy bien rieng cua theme, sinh/sua o buoc khac). Duoc tu do doi font (Google Fonts link), tailwind.config (mau sac, fontFamily), bo cuc <body> ngoai cac phan bat buoc tren.
{% endcomment %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title>
    {% if metaDescription %}<meta name="description" content="{{ metaDescription | escape }}">{% endif %}
    {% if noindex %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex">{% endif %}
    {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %}

    <!-- Fonts: Poppins (mang chatbot-lite sang) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            dark: '#0A132B',   /* Navy dam - text/heading/footer */
                            DEFAULT: '#2563eb', /* Blue-600 - nut/accent chinh */
                            hover: '#1d4ed8',    /* Blue-700 - hover state */
                            light: '#eff6ff',    /* Blue-50 - nen nhat */
                            gray: '#64748B'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Poppins', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'glass': '0 8px 32px 0 rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08)',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css">
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-slate-900 bg-white min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-brand selection:text-white">

    {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %}

    {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", breadcrumbs: breadcrumbs, breadcrumbVariant: "default" %}

    <main class="flex-grow">
        {% block content %}{% endblock %}
    </main>

    {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %}

    {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}

    <!-- Live Chat -->
    {% if site.cskhAgentId %}
      {% render "components/customer-chat", site: site, chatSessionId: chatSessionId, chatHmacToken: chatHmacToken %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Custom JS -->
    <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
